text I slide off my seat and stay low to the ground.
text I crawl toward the exit.
text This is the hard part.
text I have to open the sliding door as quietly as possible.
text Just as I'm about to begin this delicate job, feeling like a nervous member of the bomb squad...
text *Rattle* *Rattle*
text For some reason, the sliding door opens on its own.
text Looks like someone opened it.
text Still on the ground, I slowly look up.
