fi
sound C3E.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, hello.
text Next to her hand is a lunch box wrapped in cloth.
text It's smaller than yesterday's, but still larger than the one I first saw her with.
sound C3F.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I made Chinese food today.
text She opens the lid as she says that.
text Fried noodles, shrimp in chili sauce, spring rolls, dumplings, meat balls...
sound C3G.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I also made fried rice with shrimp and bamboo shoots.
text She points at each one and describes them with joy.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm hungry. Let's hurry up and eat.
text I grab a chair and sit down. It's a strange feeling, as if I've come home.
sound C3H.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Here. These are your chopsticks, Tomoya-kun.
sound C3I.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text And these are mine.
