text She asks me with a worried look.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, this is just right...
text After reviewing the side dishes again, I tell her that.
text There are about the same number of dishes as yesterday, but less food overall.
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't it hard making this many different kinds?
